# Plans vs design docs

## Do

- When creating an implementation plan (`mobiai-mobile-planning`), **always** write it to `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature-name>.md` unless the user explicitly says not to save that plan.
- Create `docs/plans/` if missing.
- Stage the plan file with the rest of the task files.

## Do not

- Do **not** create `docs/designs/` (or dated design-doc folders) for brainstorming/design capture.
- Capture approved design requirements in `spec.md` (or `specs/` / `spec/`) and important architecture decisions in `.mobiai/brain/` — not in `docs/designs/`.

## Clarification

Rejecting design docs ≠ rejecting plans. Prefer `docs/plans/` even if the user previously asked to avoid `docs/designs/`.
